            "name": "PuzzmoQuery",
            "operationKind": "query",
            "text": "query PuzzmoQuery(\n  $partnerSlug: ID\n) {\n  system {\n    todayDateKey\n    contextFlags\n    id\n  }\n  ...PuzzmoFragment\n  publishingPartner(id: $partnerSlug) {\n    id\n    slug\n    name\n    status\n    requiresPassword\n    currency\n    externalMarketID\n    newsletterOnDefault\n    requireAcceptanceOfTOS\n    flags\n    logoWidth\n    logoHeight\n    logoLongBlack\n    logoLongWhite\n    themeOverrides\n    navHeight\n    theirLogoOffsets\n    ourLogoOffsets\n    ourLogoFGOverride\n    backMessage\n    backURL\n    appearance\n    navFG\n    navBG\n    bgColor\n    ourLogoFG\n    tosURL\n    policyURL\n    shareURL\n  }\n}\n\nfragment OauthConnectionsFragment on User {\n  authConnections {\n    handle\n    type\n    avatarURL\n    displayName\n  }\n}\n\nfragment PuzzmoCurrentUserFragment on User {\n  id\n  type\n  userAccounts {\n    id\n    email\n    emailVerified\n    users {\n      id\n      avatarURL\n      name\n      username\n      usernameID\n    }\n    subscriptionActive\n    trialEligible\n  }\n  authConnections {\n    type\n  }\n  ...OauthConnectionsFragment\n  flagsArr\n  roles\n  username\n  usernameID\n  publishingName\n  avatarURL\n  name\n  nakamaID\n  notificationsCursor\n  customType\n  settings\n  preferredPartner {\n    id\n    backMessage\n    backURL\n    appearance\n    themeOverrides\n    slug\n  }\n  friendNakamaIDs\n  emailSHA\n  followingCount\n}\n\nfragment PuzzmoCurrentUserStateFragment on UserState {\n  cookieConsent\n  country\n  gameSettings\n  siteSettings {\n    haptics\n    sounds\n  }\n  givenLocationSuffix\n  id\n  nakamaLogin\n  nakamaPassword\n  ownerID\n  policy\n  streak\n  gamesPlayed\n  gameCenterID\n  atGamesCap\n}\n\nfragment PuzzmoFragment on Query {\n  currentUser {\n    ...PuzzmoCurrentUserFragment\n    id\n  }\n  userState {\n    ...PuzzmoCurrentUserStateFragment\n    id\n  }\n}\n"
          },
